#: admin/views/page-settings.php:23
msgid "General"
msgstr "Allgemein"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:24
msgid "Alerts"
msgstr "Alarme"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:25
msgid "Login & Location"
msgstr "Login & Standort"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:26
msgid "File Integrity"
msgstr "Dateiintegrität"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:30
msgid "Security Center Settings"
msgstr "Security-Center-Einstellungen"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:48
msgid "Alert recipients"
msgstr "Alarm-Empfänger"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:53
msgid "One e-mail address per line. Alerts are sent immediately, with no delay and no digest."
msgstr "Eine E-Mail-Adresse pro Zeile. Alarme gehen sofort raus, ohne Verzögerung und ohne Sammelmeldung."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:57
msgid "Sender name"
msgstr "Absendername"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:61
msgid "Sender address"
msgstr "Absenderadresse"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:64
msgid "Leave empty to use the WordPress default sender."
msgstr "Leer lassen, um den Standardabsender von WordPress zu verwenden."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:68
msgid "Hourly e-mail limit"
msgstr "Stündliches E-Mail-Limit"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:71
msgid "A safety valve, not a digest. Alerts are always immediate; only if this many messages are sent within an hour is delivery paused and a single summary sent instead. Every event is still written to the log. 0 disables the limit."
msgstr "Ein Sicherheitsventil, keine Sammelmeldung. Alarme gehen immer sofort raus; erst wenn innerhalb einer Stunde so viele Nachrichten versendet wurden, pausiert der Versand und es geht eine einzelne Zusammenfassung raus. Protokolliert wird trotzdem jedes Ereignis. 0 deaktiviert das Limit."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:75
msgid "Keep log entries for"
msgstr "Protokolleinträge aufbewahren für"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:78
#: admin/views/page-settings.php:280
msgid "days"
msgstr "Tage"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:79
msgid "Older entries are removed daily. 0 keeps everything forever."
msgstr "Ältere Einträge werden täglich entfernt. 0 behält alles dauerhaft."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:83
msgid "On uninstall"
msgstr "Bei Deinstallation"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:87
msgid "Delete the event log and all settings when the plugin is uninstalled"
msgstr "Ereignisprotokoll und alle Einstellungen bei der Deinstallation löschen"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:89
msgid "Off by default. Discarding an audit trail should be a deliberate choice."
msgstr "Standardmässig aus. Ein Prüfprotokoll zu verwerfen sollte eine bewusste Entscheidung sein."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:97
msgid "Verify delivery"
msgstr "Zustellung prüfen"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:98
msgid "This plugin is only worth anything if its alerts actually arrive. A rejected sender address fails silently on many hosts, so it is worth proving delivery once."
msgstr "Dieses Plugin ist nur etwas wert, wenn seine Alarme auch ankommen. Eine abgelehnte Absenderadresse scheitert auf vielen Hostings stillschweigend — es lohnt sich, die Zustellung einmal nachzuweisen."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:101
msgid "Send a test alert"
msgstr "Testalarm senden"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:107
msgid "Choose what happens for each event. \"E-mail\" sends immediately and also writes to the log; \"Log only\" records it without sending; \"Off\" ignores the event entirely."
msgstr "Lege für jedes Ereignis fest, was passiert. „E-Mail“ versendet sofort und protokolliert zusätzlich; „Nur protokollieren“ zeichnet auf, ohne zu versenden; „Aus“ ignoriert das Ereignis vollständig."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:127
#: admin/views/page-settings.php:176
msgid "Action"
msgstr "Aktion"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:140
msgid "E-mail"
msgstr "E-Mail"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:140
msgid "Log only"
msgstr "Nur protokollieren"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:140
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Aus"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:167
#: admin/views/page-status.php:51
msgid "Location checks"
msgstr "Standortprüfung"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:171
msgid "Evaluate and log the country of every successful login"
msgstr "Land jedes erfolgreichen Logins auswerten und protokollieren"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:180
msgid "Monitor only — alert, but let the login through"
msgstr "Nur beobachten — alarmieren, den Login aber durchlassen"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:184
msgid "Block logins from countries that are not on the list"
msgstr "Logins aus Ländern sperren, die nicht auf der Liste stehen"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:187
msgid "Blocking cannot be armed: no working country lookup is available. Install a GeoIP database below, or configure a trusted CDN country header."
msgstr "Die Sperre lässt sich nicht scharf schalten: Es steht keine funktionierende Länderermittlung zur Verfügung. Installiere unten eine GeoIP-Datenbank oder richte einen vertrauenswürdigen CDN-Länder-Header ein."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:189
msgid "Blocking cannot be armed while the country list is empty."
msgstr "Die Sperre lässt sich nicht scharf schalten, solange die Länderliste leer ist."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:192
msgid "An address whose country cannot be determined counts as not allowed and is blocked. VPN and Tor traffic usually falls into this category. If the lookup breaks entirely, blocking switches itself back to monitor mode rather than locking everyone out."
msgstr "Eine Adresse, deren Land sich nicht ermitteln lässt, gilt als nicht erlaubt und wird gesperrt. VPN- und Tor-Verkehr fällt in der Regel in diese Kategorie. Fällt die Ermittlung ganz aus, schaltet die Sperre selbst in den Beobachtungsmodus zurück, statt alle auszusperren."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:197
#: admin/views/page-status.php:66
msgid "Allowed countries"
msgstr "Erlaubte Länder"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:201
msgid "Two-letter ISO country codes, separated by spaces. For example: CH DE AT"
msgstr "Zweibuchstabige ISO-Ländercodes, durch Leerzeichen getrennt. Zum Beispiel: CH DE AT"

#. translators: 1: country name, 2: country code
#: admin/views/page-settings.php:206
#, php-format
msgid "You are currently connecting from %1$s (%2$s)."
msgstr "Du verbindest dich derzeit aus %1$s (%2$s)."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:216
msgid "Always-allowed addresses"
msgstr "Immer erlaubte Adressen"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:219
msgid "One IP address or CIDR block per line, IPv4 or IPv6. These skip the country rule entirely. Private, loopback and link-local addresses are always allowed and need not be listed."
msgstr "Eine IP-Adresse oder ein CIDR-Block pro Zeile, IPv4 oder IPv6. Diese umgehen die Länderregel vollständig. Private, Loopback- und Link-Local-Adressen sind ohnehin immer erlaubt und müssen nicht eingetragen werden."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:223
#: admin/views/page-status.php:92
msgid "Trusted proxies"
msgstr "Vertrauenswürdige Proxys"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:226
msgid "Forwarding headers such as X-Forwarded-For are read ONLY when the connecting address is in this list. Leave it empty if the site is not behind a proxy or CDN — trusting a header that anyone can send would let an attacker choose their own apparent location."
msgstr "Weiterleitungs-Header wie X-Forwarded-For werden NUR ausgewertet, wenn die verbindende Adresse in dieser Liste steht. Lass sie leer, wenn die Website nicht hinter einem Proxy oder CDN steht — einem Header zu vertrauen, den jeder senden kann, liesse einen Angreifer seinen scheinbaren Standort selbst wählen."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:229
msgid "Use the country header supplied by the CDN (CF-IPCountry) when available"
msgstr "Den vom CDN gelieferten Länder-Header (CF-IPCountry) verwenden, wenn vorhanden"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:234
msgid "API authentication"
msgstr "API-Authentifizierung"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:238
msgid "Apply location rules to application passwords and XML-RPC as well"
msgstr "Standortregeln auch auf Anwendungspasswörter und XML-RPC anwenden"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:240
msgid "Off by default. These authenticate through the same mechanism as an interactive login, so turning this on can silently break integrations whose servers sit abroad."
msgstr "Standardmässig aus. Diese authentifizieren über denselben Mechanismus wie ein interaktiver Login — einschalten kann Integrationen, deren Server im Ausland stehen, stillschweigend lahmlegen."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:244
msgid "Bypass link"
msgstr "Notfall-Link"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:248
msgid "E-mail a single-use recovery link whenever a login is blocked"
msgstr "Bei jedem gesperrten Login einen einmalig nutzbaren Wiederherstellungslink versenden"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:251
msgid "Link valid for"
msgstr "Link gültig für"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:253
msgid "minutes"
msgstr "Minuten"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:256
msgid "grants access for"
msgstr "gewährt Zugang für"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:258
msgid "hours"
msgstr "Stunden"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:264
msgid "MaxMind licence key"
msgstr "MaxMind-Lizenzschlüssel"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:272
msgid "The key is set in wp-config.php via WPSEC_MAXMIND_LICENSE_KEY and cannot be edited here."
msgstr "Der Schlüssel ist in der wp-config.php über WPSEC_MAXMIND_LICENSE_KEY gesetzt und lässt sich hier nicht bearbeiten."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:274
msgid "A free GeoLite2 key from MaxMind. The database cannot be bundled with the plugin because MaxMind's licence forbids redistributing it. Defining WPSEC_MAXMIND_LICENSE_KEY in wp-config.php keeps the key out of the database entirely."
msgstr "Ein kostenloser GeoLite2-Schlüssel von MaxMind. Die Datenbank darf dem Plugin nicht beiliegen, weil MaxMinds Lizenz die Weitergabe verbietet. WPSEC_MAXMIND_LICENSE_KEY in der wp-config.php hält den Schlüssel vollständig aus der Datenbank heraus."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:278
msgid "Warn when the database is older than"
msgstr "Warnen, wenn die Datenbank älter ist als"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:290
msgid "Quick actions"
msgstr "Schnellaktionen"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:293
msgid "Download the GeoIP database now"
msgstr "GeoIP-Datenbank jetzt herunterladen"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:298
msgid "Add my current country to the list"
msgstr "Mein aktuelles Land zur Liste hinzufügen"

#. translators: %s: preset name
#: admin/views/page-settings.php:310
#, php-format
msgid "Add trusted proxies: %s"
msgstr "Vertrauenswürdige Proxys hinzufügen: %s"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:325
msgid "The plugin never modifies, quarantines or deletes a file. It only reports what it finds."
msgstr "Das Plugin verändert, verschiebt und löscht niemals eine Datei. Es meldet nur, was es findet."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:330
msgid "What to scan"
msgstr "Was geprüft wird"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:332
msgid "wp-content/mu-plugins — loads before everything and cannot be deactivated from the dashboard"
msgstr "wp-content/mu-plugins — lädt vor allem anderen und lässt sich im Backend nicht deaktivieren"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:333
msgid "PHP files under wp-content/uploads — one should never exist there"
msgstr "PHP-Dateien unter wp-content/uploads — dort gehört nie eine hin"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:334
msgid "wp-config.php and .htaccess"
msgstr "wp-config.php und .htaccess"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:335
msgid "WordPress core files, against the official checksums"
msgstr "WordPress-Kerndateien, gegen die offiziellen Prüfsummen"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:339
msgid "Backdoor heuristics"
msgstr "Backdoor-Heuristik"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:341
msgid "Check new PHP files for patterns common in web shells"
msgstr "Neue PHP-Dateien auf Muster prüfen, die für Web-Shells typisch sind"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:343
msgid "Report at a score of"
msgstr "Melden ab einem Wert von"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:345
msgid "out of 100"
msgstr "von 100"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:348
msgid "Lower catches more and produces more false positives. Every pattern here has legitimate uses on its own; the score is what distinguishes them."
msgstr "Niedriger findet mehr und erzeugt mehr Fehlalarme. Jedes einzelne Muster hat für sich genommen legitime Verwendungen; erst der Wert unterscheidet sie."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:352
msgid "Files per scan run"
msgstr "Dateien pro Prüflauf"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:355
msgid "A ceiling so a very large uploads directory cannot exhaust the PHP time limit. Anything not reached is covered by the next run."
msgstr "Eine Obergrenze, damit ein sehr grosses Upload-Verzeichnis nicht das PHP-Zeitlimit sprengt. Was nicht erreicht wurde, deckt der nächste Lauf ab."

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:359
msgid "Ignore paths containing"
msgstr "Pfade ignorieren, die enthalten"

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:362
msgid "One fragment per line. Anything whose path contains it is skipped."
